—————————————-\n再次來訪，這次點了真*蝦味噌拉麵升級豪華海鮮套餐，總共有五隻蝦子還有4片魚跟兩片叉燒及三片蝦餅，另外蝦子還很貼心的去殼了呢，滿滿的海味。\n另外還點了唐揚豆腐，每一塊都呈現完美的長方形，再搭配附贈的泡菜，配在一起吃有種吃臭豆腐的感覺，但又不會臭的那種，算是蠻特別的滋味，下次還要再來～",null,[0,124]]]],[null,1767010577000000,1767010577000000,"8 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfVVVCWEVqa0ZObW41WW93V052T285UQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfVVVCWEVqa0ZObW41WW93V052T285URoTQ2d3SWtlTEp5Z1lRcWRMQm1nRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiyrsCyxNKWAxXdcvUHHYCYFFgQ_2MIXSgN"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12339503790484123117/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUW1GdFRubFRNR1JoWW14d01WbHJTbGRaVlhCMVpHcEZlbHBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12339503790484123117/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUW1GdFRubFRNR1JoWW14d01WbHJTbGRaVlhCMVpHcEZlbHBHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12339503790484123117/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUW1GdFRubFRNR1JoWW14d01WbHJTbGRaVlhCMVpHcEZlbHBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12339503790484123117/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUW1GdFRubFRNR1JoWW14d01WbHJTbGRaVlhCMVpHcEZlbHBHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12339503790484123117/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUW1GdFRubFRNR1JoWW14d01WbHJTbGRaVlhCMVpHcEZlbHBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12339503790484123117/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUW1GdFRubFRNR1JoWW14d01WbHJTbGRaVlhCMVpHcEZlbHBHUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你的喜歡，讓拉麵美味是我們的使命，你的鼓勵是我們店繼續努力的動力，繼續鼓勵不要停哦~",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,2111,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQmFtTnlTMGRhYmxwMVlrSldZVXB1ZGpFelpGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd3cc46494ee678f0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNBamNyS0dablp1YkJWYUpudjEzZFE